ved-issues.com/grimmskull/about/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;A nefarious Nazi science experiment aims to melt the flesh off the Allied powers, starting with an American soldier on a mission to stop it. Chronicles of the Great Grimmskull delivers a night the Führer will never forget.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Originally created in 2013, we revived Chronicles of the Great Grimmskull in 2026 and gave it a proper remaster: a new cover, new letters, color, and new pages at the end to wrap the story up properly.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>